  "lyrics": [
    {
      "text": "When I find myself in times of trouble, Mother Mary comes to me",
      "start_time": 13.328,
      "end_time": 20.526
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaking words of wisdom, let it be",
      "start_time": 20.526,
      "end_time": 27.191
    },
    {
      "text": "And in my hour of darkness, she is standing right in front of me",
      "start_time": 27.191,
      "end_time": 33.692
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaking words of wisdom, let it be",
      "start_time": 33.692,
      "end_time": 40.519
    },
    {
      "text": "Let it be, let it be, let it be, let it be",
      "start_time": 40.519,
      "end_time": 47.206
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisper words of wisdom, let it be",
      "start_time": 47.206,
      "end_time": 54.056
    },
    {
      "text": "And when the broken hearted people, living in the world agree",
      "start_time": 54.056,
      "end_time": 60.511
    },
    {
      "text": "There will be an answer, let it be",
      "start_time": 60.511,
      "end_time": 67.129
    },
    {
      "text": "But though they may be parted, there is still a chance that they may see",
      "start_time": 67.129,
      "end_time": 73.863
    },
    {
      "text": "There will be an answer, let it be",
      "start_time": 73.863,
