    },
    {
      "text": "Whisper words of wisdom, let it be",
      "start_time": 169.799,
      "end_time": 176.788
    },
    {
      "text": "And when the night is cloudy, there is still a light that shines on me",
      "start_time": 176.788,
      "end_time": 183.731
    },
    {
      "text": "Shine on till tomorrow, let it be",
      "start_time": 183.731,
      "end_time": 190.627
